        <item>
            <title>3.6.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Sep 2024 21:15:02 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>283</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3 id="v3-6-1">v3.6.1</h3>
                <h4 id="bugfixes">Bugfixes</h4>
                <ul>
                <li>Fixed a regression where the system HUDs would be shown on all screens.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3 id="v3-6-0">v3.6.0</h3>
                <h4 id="new-features">New Features</h4>
                <ul>
                <li>Added an option to show the Volume HUD when the Now Playing HUD is shown</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 id="impovements">Impovements</h4>
                <ul>
                <li>A new option has been added to the Notch section to adjust the virtual notch size if it doesn&#39;t match the physical notch size</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 id="bugfixes">Bugfixes</h4>
                <ul>
                <li>Fixed an issue where the HUD placement would not correctly respond to screen locking / unlocking</li>
                <li>Fixed an issue where the iOS-themed HUD would not transition correctly with Blur transitions on macOS 15</li>
                <li>Fixed an issue where a HUD preview would not disappear when closing the settings window on macOS 15</li>
                <li>Fixed an issue where the Now Playing HUD would not work correctly with Orion browser</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
